06/343", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/345", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/349", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/353", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/355", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/359", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/362", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/364", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/366", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/368", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/370", "sentence": ["…術会議が行うと明記しているわけですね。法の三条では、学術会議の職務は独立して行われるとなっているわけですよ。これ、政府からの独立なんですよ。…", "…会議の職務は独立して行われるとなっているわけですよ。これ、政府からの独立なんですよ。政府が委員の選考や推薦に実質的に関わることなどは、学術会…", "…どおりには任命しませんでした、そんなことを言い出したらば、まさに学術会議の独立を脅かし、政治介入そのものではありませんか。（発言する者あり）"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/373", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/375", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/379", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/383", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/387", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/391", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/394", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/396", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/398", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/402", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/404", "sentence": []}, {"url"